0 Fixture: a cross axle whose every hole is round.
0 Expected: problems -- NOT RETAINED.
0
0 This is the Seed Drone's first rotor mount, reduced to three parts, and it
0 is the reason the NOT RETAINED rule exists. A yellow 3M cross axle stands
0 in a round hole of the green 2x8 plate and carries the purple beam by
0 another round hole. Both joints are real: an axle fits a pin hole, and
0 ldrcheck reported them as 20-LDU joints. Neither joint holds anything.
0
0 A cross axle is smooth for its whole length, so a round bore cannot stop
0 it turning and cannot stop it sliding out. On the physical model the beam
0 lifted straight off. Every other check passed -- no interpenetration, no
0 detached subassembly, no shallow engagement -- because fitting and holding
0 are different questions and only one of them was being asked.
0
0 Compare good-axle-locked-in-cross-hole.ldr, which is this fixture plus the
0 dark-green 2x4 brick whose CROSS holes give the same axle something to bite.
